| \`.col-start-basic\` | Sets the start position of the basic area within the Porsche Grid. |
| \`.col-end-basic\` | Sets the end position of the basic area within the Porsche Grid. |

### Grid — Extended

| Tailwind \`@utility\` class | Description |
| --- | --- |
